{"type": "message", "id": "dab64504", "parentId": "e15f6080", "timestamp": "2026-04-08T11:19:25.493Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_function_gfiws142mv7r_2", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Tesla Q2 2023 quarterly revenue net income results June 30 2023\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 948,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95235a3feab71f08\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Releases Second Quarter 2023 Financial Results | Tesla Investor Relations\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95235a3feab71f08\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ir.tesla.com/press-release/tesla-releases-second-quarter-2023-financial-results\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"71a7a5ce143bee5d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAUSTIN, Texas, July 19, 2023 – Tesla has released its financial results for the second quarter of 2023 by posting an update on its Investor Relations website. Please visit <strong>https://ir.tesla.com</strong> to view the update.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"71a7a5ce143bee5d\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 19, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ir.tesla.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ca72d1035b4c7801\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nfile: tsla-ex99_1.htm\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ca72d1035b4c7801\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1318605/000095017023033544/tsla-ex99_1.htm\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"371e0ae69f01c080\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nS U M M A R Y H I G H L I G H T ... candidate builds Profitability 9.6% operating margin $2.4B GAAP operating income $2.7B GAAP net income <strong>$3.1B non-GAAP net income</strong>1 Q2-2023 was a record quarter on many levels with our best-ever production and deliveries and revenue approaching ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"371e0ae69f01c080\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sec.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"840b9d1ef4841516\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla (TSLA) earnings Q2 2023\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"840b9d1ef4841516\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cnbc.com/2023/07/19/tesla-tsla-earnings-q2-2023.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b63615749934908d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nEarnings: 91 cents per share adjusted, versus 82 cents per share expected as per Refinitiv. Net income (GAAP) was <strong>$2.70 billion</strong>, an increase of 20% from last year. Operating income, however, was off 3% from the year-ago quarter at $2.40 billion.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b63615749934908d\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 20, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnbc.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c2b8eb439a32ac11\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Q2 2023 Earnings Report: Profitable Again, Beat Expect... - moomoo Community\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c2b8eb439a32ac11\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.moomoo.com/community/feed/110743072014342\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"def0a2708c89497f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n... Net income (GAAP) was <strong>$2.70 billion</strong>, an increase of 20% from last year. By way of comparison, during the first quarter of 2023, Tesla reported net income of $2.51 billion on revenue of $23.33 billion.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"def0a2708c89497f\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.moomoo.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"38397759116d75aa\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Q2 2023 results | Automotive World\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"38397759116d75aa\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.automotiveworld.com/articles/tesla-q2-2023-results/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"824004c4e2e04be9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe effects of Tesla’s (several) price cuts during 2023 are plain to see in its Q2 results: deliveries rose by 83% to 466,000 units, revenue grew at just over half that rate, up 47% to <strong>US$24.9bn</strong> but operating profit dropped by 2.6% and the ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"824004c4e2e04be9\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"July 21, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.automotiveworld.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "Tesla Q2 2023 quarterly revenue net income results June 30 2023", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 948, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"95235a3feab71f08\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla Releases Second Quarter 2023 Financial Results | Tesla Investor Relations\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"95235a3feab71f08\">>>", "url": "https://ir.tesla.com/press-release/tesla-releases-second-quarter-2023-financial-results", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"71a7a5ce143bee5d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nAUSTIN, Texas, July 19, 2023 – Tesla has released its financial results for the second quarter of 2023 by posting an update on its Investor Relations website. Please visit <strong>https://ir.tesla.com</strong> to view the update.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"71a7a5ce143bee5d\">>>", "published": "July 19, 2023", "siteName": "ir.tesla.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ca72d1035b4c7801\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nfile: tsla-ex99_1.htm\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UN