.33 billion.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"def0a2708c89497f\">>>", "siteName": "www.moomoo.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"38397759116d75aa\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla Q2 2023 results | Automotive World\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"38397759116d75aa\">>>", "url": "https://www.automotiveworld.com/articles/tesla-q2-2023-results/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"824004c4e2e04be9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe effects of Tesla’s (several) price cuts during 2023 are plain to see in its Q2 results: deliveries rose by 83% to 466,000 units, revenue grew at just over half that rate, up 47% to <strong>US$24.9bn</strong> but operating profit dropped by 2.6% and the ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"824004c4e2e04be9\">>>", "published": "July 21, 2023", "siteName": "www.automotiveworld.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775647165492}}
