ier. Total gross profit declined 22% year ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"07fa060c2733cc69\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"November 9, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnbc.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b6c4ba0ee868dd92\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nQ3 2023 Update 1\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b6c4ba0ee868dd92\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://digitalassets.tesla.com/tesla-contents/image/upload/IR/TSLA-Q3-2023-Update-3.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b013b6f0751a172b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nYoY, revenue was impacted by the following items: ... Our operating income decreased YoY to <strong>$1.8B</strong> in Q3, resulting in a 7.6% operating margin. YoY, operating income was ... + growth in vehicle deliveries (despite the margin headwind from underutilization from new factories) ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b013b6f0751a172b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"digitalassets.tesla.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"30dd93d1af30b786\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla profits dip as it invests in factory upgrades and AI development | The Verge\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"30dd93d1af30b786\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.theverge.com/2023/10/18/23919336/tesla-q3-2023-earnings-revenue-profit-margin\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"66a77b33eccfaa41\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nToday the company reported earnings of $1.9 billion in net income on <strong>$23.4 billion</strong> in revenue during the third quarter of 2023. The figures represent a small bump in revenue, from $21.4 billion the same time last year, but a big dip in profits, ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"66a77b33eccfaa41\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 18, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.theverge.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1b2750be34aae992\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla (TSLA) Q3 2023 Earnings: What to Expect | Nasdaq\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1b2750be34aae992\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/tesla-tsla-q3-2023-earnings-what-to-expect\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c565ad575ebacdc6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWith net income of <strong>$3.14 billion</strong> on revenue of $24.9 billion, the net profit margin was 12.6%. What’s more, the company posted a 62% jump in free cash flow. However, the net profit margin declined to 12.6%, from 15.4% in the year-ago quarter.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c565ad575ebacdc6\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 18, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nasdaq.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "Tesla Q3 2023 revenue net income quarterly results September 30 2023", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 895, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cb46150a60de6187\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla (TSLA) Q3 2023 earnings results: $23.5B in revenue and 17.9% gross margin\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cb46150a60de6187\">>>", "url": "https://www.teslarati.com/tesla-tsla-q3-2023-earnings-results/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bbb766d4c8e48c16\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIn the third quarter, Tesla posted revenues of <strong>$23.35 billion</strong>. Analysts expected Tesla to report a revenue of $24.16 billion in Q3 2023.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bbb766d4c8e48c16\">>>", "published": "October 18, 2023", "siteName": "www.teslarati.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"3bb43020a6206256\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla (TSLA) earnings Q3 2023\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CO