mp in revenue, from $21.4 billion the same time last year, but a big dip in profits, ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"66a77b33eccfaa41\">>>", "published": "October 18, 2023", "siteName": "www.theverge.com"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1b2750be34aae992\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTesla (TSLA) Q3 2023 Earnings: What to Expect | Nasdaq\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1b2750be34aae992\">>>", "url": "https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/tesla-tsla-q3-2023-earnings-what-to-expect", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c565ad575ebacdc6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWith net income of <strong>$3.14 billion</strong> on revenue of $24.9 billion, the net profit margin was 12.6%. What’s more, the company posted a 62% jump in free cash flow. However, the net profit margin declined to 12.6%, from 15.4% in the year-ago quarter.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c565ad575ebacdc6\">>>", "published": "October 18, 2023", "siteName": "www.nasdaq.com"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775647174781}}
